==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы́-|води́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|выводи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-выводить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|выводи́ть|impf|pf=вы́вести}}

# to [[take out]], to [[lead out]], to [[bring out]], to [[move out]]; to [[help]] [[out]] {{gloss|help someone to get off}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[на]] [[чистый|чи́стую]] [[вода|во́ду]]|t=to bring out into the open, to expose, to unmask, to show up}}
# to [[withdraw]], to [[call off]] (troops)
# to [[derive]], to [[conclude]], to [[infer]], to [[deduce]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[формула|фо́рмулу]]|t=to deduce / derive a formula}}
# to [[remove]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[из]] [[состав|соста́ва]] [[президиум|прези́диума]]|t=to '''remove''' from the presidium}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[из]] [[себя́]]|t=to drive someone out of his wits, to drive someone to distraction; to drive someone crazy|lit=to '''remove''' (someone) from [[himself]]/[[herself]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[этот|Э́та]] [[про́бка]] '''выво́дит''' [[я|меня́]] [[из]] [[себя́]]|This traffic jam '''is driving''' me '''crazy'''.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[из]] [[терпение|терпе́ния]]|t=to make someone lose patience, to exasperate someone|lit=to '''remove''' (someone) from [[patience]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[из]] стро́я|t=to put out of action / operation / commission, to disable, to wreck|lit=to '''remove''' from the [[order]]}}
# to [[extirpate]], to [[destroy]]; to [[exterminate]] (pests); to [[remove]] (stains, pimples)
# {{lb|ru|biology}} to [[excrete]]
# {{lb|ru|biology|agriculture}} to [[breed]], to [[selection]] the new [[breed]] or [[sort]]
# {{lb|ru|computing}} to [[display]] the [[results]] of a [[program]] [[operation]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[текст]] [[на]] [[печать|печа́ть]]|t=to '''print''' text}}
# {{lb|ru|computing}} to [[save]] the [[results]] of a [[program]] [[operation]] [[outside]] of its [[RAM]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''выводи́ть''' [[да́нные|да́нные]] [[в]] [[файл]]|t=to '''output''' data to a file}}
#* {{quote|ru|[[студия|Сту́дия]] [[позволяет|позволя́ет]] '''выводи́ть''' [[фильмы|фи́льмы]] [[непосредственно|непосре́дственно]] [[на]] [[диск]] VideoCD.|t=Studio allows you to '''output''' films directly to VideoCD disc.}}

